{"id":"n62791-2-7","stage":3,"title":"딴 · 其他","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62791-2-7-1","ko":"요새 민준이한테 평소와 다른 이상한 점 못 느꼈어?","zh":"最近没觉得敏俊和平时不一样吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요새","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이한테","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"민준이한테","audio":"/audio/61ffa7b81d49a5485c64.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이한테","audio":"/audio/61ffa7b81d49a5485c64.mp3"}},{"text":"평소와","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"평소와","audio":"/audio/bd2eec97b797c2e4429b.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"与众不同，非同一般","explanation":"다르다：与众不同，非同一般；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"2","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"이상한","meaning":"异常，反常，不正常","explanation":"이상하다：异常，反常，不正常；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71167","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상한","audio":"/audio/a464c05fbb9eba9ac3b9.mp3"}},{"text":"점","meaning":"点，片，丝","explanation":"점：点，片，丝","readings":[{"term":"점","audio":"/audio/59a79337fd9ab69bc177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62381","senseId":"4","lemma":"점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점","audio":"/audio/59a79337fd9ab69bc177.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"느꼈어?","meaning":"感受，觉得，感到","explanation":"느끼다：感受，觉得，感到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"2","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느꼈어","audio":"/audio/8584ee725473001629cd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e1177912c702a7a","term":"요새","zh":"近来，日来，最近","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3","entryId":"67864","definition":"从不久前到现在的非常短的期间。","pronunciation":["요새"]},{"id":"ebf09ee6c46b848f","term":"평소","zh":"平常，平时，平日","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3","entryId":"71341","definition":"没有特别事情，通常的时候。","pronunciation":["평소"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"与众不同，非同一般","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"与普通的事物或人不一样，有特别的一面。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"8ccfeb4ba6659178","term":"이상하다","zh":"异常，反常，不正常","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3","entryId":"71167","definition":"与正常的不同。","pronunciation":["이ː상하다"]},{"id":"59a79337fd9ab69b","term":"점","zh":"点，片，丝","audio":"/audio/59a79337fd9ab69bc177.mp3","entryId":"62381","definition":"形容非常少的量。","pronunciation":["점"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"内心经历某种情感。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff0824b7c0a9e7cb54ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62791-2-7-2","ko":"요즘 말도 많이 준 게 딴 사람 같았어.","zh":"最近话少了很多，简直像变了个人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"말도","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말도","audio":"/audio/6464a9af34c6a3e538bb.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"준","meaning":"加，增加","explanation":"주다：加，增加；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"7","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준","audio":"/audio/380bd5afbff5e69e5943.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"딴","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"딴：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"딴","audio":"/audio/cece9bb9f3ddc58383e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62791","senseId":"2","lemma":"딴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딴","audio":"/audio/cece9bb9f3ddc58383e4.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"같았어.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같았어","audio":"/audio/3b4f3b9831b5b668d031.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"加，增加","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"增强速度或力量等。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"cece9bb9f3ddc583","term":"딴","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/cece9bb9f3ddc58383e4.mp3","entryId":"62791","definition":"有关东西以外的。","pronunciation":["딴"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/au